# VPN egress check environment variables
# Copy to .vpn-egress.env and fill in values
# Sourced by scripts/vpn-egress-check.sh (not a compose stack — no symlink needed)
#
# The whole file is optional: without it the script still runs and still exits
# non-zero on a leak, it just does not report anywhere.

# Healthchecks.io ping URL for VPN leak monitoring (optional — pings are
# skipped if unset). Create a check at https://healthchecks.io matching the
# cron interval below (schedule: every 10 min, grace ~30m) and paste its ping
# URL here. Use a *separate* check from the backup one so a leak alert is not
# confused with a backup alert.
HEALTHCHECKS_URL='https://hc-ping.com/your-check-uuid'
